## Upstream and third-party code

VRCX Android 1.x is modelled on VRCX by pypy and contributors, and its launcher
icon is VRCX's speech-bubble mark. Any part taken from VRCX was received under
the MIT License below, which continues to apply to it and must be retained; the
original project remains available at https://github.com/vrcx-team/VRCX. The
terms above cover only the code written for VRCX Android: the Android app in
`app/`, and the build files, scripts and documentation around it.

